{"id":10000030,"name":"钟离","enName":"Zhongli","title":"尘世闲游","element":"岩","region":"璃月","rarity":5,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"12月31日","constellation":"岩王帝君座","description":"被「往生堂」请来的神秘客人，知识渊博，对各种事物都颇有见地。","affiliation":"璃月港","cv":{"chinese":"彭博","japanese":"前野智昭","english":"基思·西尔弗斯坦","korean":"表永宰"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000030-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000030-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Zhongli.zip","voicePackageEn":"Zhongli","quoteCount":75,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"一份新的「契约」？好吧…虽然我还在度假，但也可以陪你走一趟。契约书上，该签什么名字呢？我有许多名字，度假期间的话…我会自称「钟离」。你呢，旅行者？你会签下什么名字？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/jienvw1v4ncot5i4o0k85nudkzl7wyn.ogg"},{"title":"闲聊·旅程","desc":"旅程总有一天会迎来终点，不必匆忙。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_explore_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/t6so5b76ffd1o2gyc97ekiygua90inm.ogg"},{"title":"闲聊·游览","desc":"接下来想去哪里？如果想游历璃月名胜的话，我有一些不错的参考方案。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_explore_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/3l8b8qrhtsnn777ia3f650umf2rv1j5.ogg"},{"title":"闲聊·璃月","desc":"为「流通」而造的船，遇到港口也会停泊，所以璃月是一切财富「沉淀」的地方。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_explore_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/048rzse4mqjs1jfpsd0ieqf1tc5o7g3.ogg"},{"title":"闲聊·怀旧","desc":"欲买桂花同载酒…只可惜故人，何日再见呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_explore_idle_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/11/7r8zj0adhhwk206yqj8a9pqt2iouwqd.ogg"},{"title":"雨过天晴…","desc":"「琉璃袋」这种植物，它偏爱潮湿的环境，最适合雨后采摘。如果发现的话，适当储备些吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_weather_afterRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d2/hmzsx6aqa7psp0h7nfba0qwmdwsgr7k.ogg"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"找个地方避避雪吧。我不会有事，但你可能着凉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/by855ahrlou8y1l2ospr4x126xwq203.ogg"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"嗯…不适合度假的天气。去听听戏吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c6/spy83e6e0oz3bh5ffq8nxqg90dwv3kw.ogg"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"希望今日也有好景气。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/eppnx3vbb0hguc7ki6us0traxerweah.ogg"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"想要吃点提神的？嗯，吃虎岩倒是有爿不错的店…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/ax01kb0nylxlhxpqwrzxjdmw082cbhd.ogg"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"虽然这种时候已经错过了云先生的戏，但夜晚的璃月仍有许多好去处。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/pex51gw715ysvah11pzegriwz2vofjr.ogg"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"集市已收，喧闹的码头也已沉睡。去休息吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/00/pwuyva1hlevsugaakeivhmlhz6i57bd.ogg"},{"title":"关于钟离自己…","desc":"不以规矩，不能成方圆。不管是常人还是仙人，惟有各司其职，方能保璃月长久太平。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/gds8vbhh8weop8gotiv7r46tf15ttap.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·黄金","desc":"黄金是璃月的财富，是令璃月的心脏搏动的血液。你是否拥有黄金般闪耀的心，就让我拭目以待吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/3vo7atxscjjxvx5sqnbew17l9az46qx.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·契约","desc":"你我既有「契约」之交——那么凡在契约范围内的事，都可同我商量。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/imhvf935ulyhy80sv7n1jlahe69f7ge.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·公平","desc":"「契约」之外的事也可与我相谈。毕竟我在这片土地上活了这么久，凡事都略通一二。哦，虽说如此，我也有希望你能为我做的事情。毕竟，这样才符合「公平」嘛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_close3","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/5fmuvduf7u3g27a7l71zqyw3h7u5ccc.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·困惑","desc":"「契约」无法界定「友谊」、无法丈量「情谊」，那到底用什么才能称量你我之间情感的重量呢？「朋友」，你知道答案吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_close4","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a5/1xoo3qkdzw5l0iapgx4xkiazqma7v8x.ogg"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"「神之眼」…也是一种「契约」。须知一切力量皆有其代价，一千种权力伴随着一千种责任。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/iyj4qdl6eh0c5rend236vq5a1c56o8e.ogg"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"「交易」的规矩是「契约」，准则是「公平」。这是订立、遵循「契约」者绝不可忘却之事：倘若失了公平，那契约便成了欺瞒的凭据。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_share","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/ib29kz9s8am38yg89sh8d47ihr737ke.ogg"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"你若去往「绝云间」，便替我采来一束「清心」吧。一束就好。此行的旅费…啊，差些忘了，「契约」生效期间，旅费由你代为垫付。那就有劳了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/84/kvh09wmjzete1gnqvbu7oedp1zz5oh6.ogg"},{"title":"关于魈…","desc":"你说，归离原的少年仙人…啊…直至今日，他仍在履行他的职责…哦，这副「连理镇心散」，请替我带给他。对了，可千万不能让小派蒙偷吃了去，这里的药力…绝非常人所能承受。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_xiao_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/ron39w4fi945y7b8o0iwodobaqcy7rx.ogg"},{"title":"关于温迪…","desc":"嘶...好浓的酒气。那个诗人刚刚来过吧，那个和风雅二字搭不上一点关系的酒鬼诗人！你这里…唔，被他诱骗着灌了酒，话也说不清了么…你等一下，我去沏一壶「醒神茶」，只需三个时辰便好。你等一下…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_venti_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/4qc5c2a7gruhhvfazmz75w3e1lngvg4.ogg"},{"title":"关于凝光…","desc":"即便每日经手的事务千条万缕，她仍不失进取之心，实属难得。让我想起，彼时的她赤着脚从瑶光滩走到南码头，一路叫卖货品的样子。时间对于常人，真是残酷…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_ningguang_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c7/kdretd5nqpc647nvoq2hi37tw7f2uei.ogg"},{"title":"关于胡桃…","desc":"当代堂主？嗯…那孩子，我应付不来。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_hutao_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/ka9nv4gl8qzpzwmrg1j33j0now8yiyk.ogg"},{"title":"关于达达利亚·沉着","desc":"那位来自至冬的武人，还没离开璃月吗？没关系，要是他找你麻烦，你可以唤我去应付他。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_tartaglia_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/54/ipmgqaad9x15sb47evu2qo6fb8b4sdg.ogg"},{"title":"关于达达利亚·酒桌","desc":"听说「公子」最近在愚人众的风评又变糟了不少。但像他这样的人，一定会用积极的行动去扫清那些对他的怨言吧。嗯…这样想来，下回酒桌上又有不少趣事可以听了。旅者，你也一起来吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_tartaglia_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/50agp44t6u2t13netru1wj6k95p0zlu.ogg"},{"title":"关于甘雨…","desc":"璃月这个国度的繁荣，靠得绝不仅是「岩王帝君」的神谕，而是无数响应「契约」的岩神子民。在这之中，甘雨已是就职时间最长的一位了。关于她的往事…我怕她怪罪，让她自己和你说吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_ganyu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/4x9wq542dgdxzob2tr24ldqdr0jjsel.ogg"},{"title":"关于刻晴…","desc":"她是当代七星中最「不敬神」的，但我还挺欣赏这样的人。「觉得自己是正确的，就大声地说出来、坚决地去行动」——就是因为璃月有这样的人，我才会考虑退休一事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_keqing_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/dh1thstuyizo81isn94siw111aflbyz.ogg"},{"title":"关于烟绯…","desc":"她未曾与我签订「契约」，却在以自己的方式维护璃月各界的规矩，并将有失偏颇的观念纠正。倘若某天，她的父亲远游归来，想来会比我更欣慰吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_yanfei_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/4oagemu7bcken4kq7ur75abpo6zx0o3.mp3"},{"title":"关于巴尔…","desc":"时间会淬炼一切意志。而她，恰好是会为信念付出所有的人。或许正因如此，她才能走到这一步。如有机会，我也想见识一下她为之倾尽一切的「永恒」。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_raidenShogun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/n1r2j4mx5yyaxh9os4do2qj9olvl1ub.mp3"},{"title":"关于布耶尔…","desc":"智慧之神布耶尔，不仅统管整个须弥，还肩负着守护世界树的职责。若非有大智慧，的确难以司掌这些。拯救世界树一事，整个提瓦特的生灵都理应向她致谢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_nahida_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/3gmdl7d8ibwkmpnu7ppylr3t5v71d8t.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"与「自我」签订下拯救国家的契约，并严守五百年，最终骗过了天理…我尊敬一切需要自我践行的「正义」。即便神性的部分已经消散，神座不复存在，但对于整个枫丹的历史来说，芙宁娜依旧是值得被认可的正义之神。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3e/fxkumszodosc28uodeyo08ddwtxuo0w.mp3"},{"title":"关于闲云…","desc":"我听不少商人聊起过「闲云」的逸闻。说是这位女子看似倨傲，不喜言谈，交谈一番却发现她性格耿直，作风正派，是位值得结交的良友。我为她高兴。但「出手阔绰」这条评价，嗯，也有不少人对我说过…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_teammate_xianyun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/83/pxkau4i0fbj12w4kt4t39i17dfcbc8s.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解钟离·其一","desc":"怎么，难得闲暇，不好好休息却反来找我。是想听我讲故事吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/81/88tsxuvet8p1h5075x5ikeeyd8ct9cc.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解钟离·其二","desc":"「黑岩厂」的起源，听说过吗？\n在过去，人们一边将天衡山中的矿脉挖空，一边在里面修建工场设施，渐渐建成了东大陆最大的工厂。山中黯道四通八达，一些甚至能通往大地深处的古遗迹。能掌握其中一切通路的人，如今大概没有了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/qj8m5fzlvp4b71dcow7toe5brvryczj.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解钟离·其三","desc":"「海灯节」的起源，听说过吗？\n在很久以前的战争中，璃月人会在夜里放飞明亮的灯，让厮杀的战士不迷失回家的方向，不迷失自己的心。这种事情，如今大概已经没有人记得了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/2i8o7d2ighgxoevhycot77sg0g6rsap.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解钟离·其四","desc":"「契约之神」的事情，听说过吗？\n他的记性很好。每位对手的名字，璃港船局建成以来制造的每一艘船起航的日子，都不曾忘却。毕竟，有这样的记忆力，才能铭记一切「契约」。\n然而，记性很好有时是令人不快的事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/gsybip3q5et5brhsh5h9liftveeosb6.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解钟离·其五","desc":"活得太久的人，只能在记忆中寻访往昔的战友、过去的景色。\n即使如此我也不后悔与你相识，「朋友」。假使有一日不得不同你相别，你在我的记忆中也会如黄金般闪耀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/i7hj1ipbx0g0ydzkfcw5et1tzutywdd.ogg"},{"title":"钟离的爱好…","desc":"得闲时在城内散步，就能让我心安不少。嗯…这种心情，是从何时开始…？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/siw1s8yam9qijvz8nwbvqbq3be5djgu.ogg"},{"title":"钟离的烦恼…","desc":"让人们遵循「契约」，依照契约的规矩行事，其实是希望人们能遵循「公平」。只是这一点，总有人意识不到。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/3lquaxhpmnk7zx8zjjtdwa7swjoor5v.ogg"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"很久以前，与朋友共饮的酒。是因为气候变了吗？唉，过去的滋味，或许再也不能重现了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/b1afrtipfrczk3c74fha1rk3lvtuvqb.ogg"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"我不喜欢海鲜。仅仅是看到海鲜，就会想到那种…该怎么说呢，滑溜溜的触感，洗不净的腥味。哦，原因的话…\n唉，说来话长，就当是因为我记性太好了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/g31ewhf5je3j2oexguqtx3vkw7fu5aj.ogg"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"用料讲究，做法地道。属实不易。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/57/rcctmisjin93bdvu4qzrcg9llufhhng.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"烹饪是一件饶有趣味的事，想来对你而言也是如此。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/bmtwfy29ep40jplyrkuduk8z9w38ggr.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"既有闲暇，不如找一处庭院，和你说一段故事吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b2/onhkynf4dh871uqfhdx9r15nq0wdige.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐。这是曾在你出生的那天盛开的，「琉璃百合」的干花。\n很久以前的璃月人会说，这种花承载着大地中的美好记忆与祈愿而盛开。我愿意相信，你的诞生也是同样的道理。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/0npcrnieyc3k65j483qvcg1m9fqchyq.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"力量似乎渐渐回来了。不多，但有用。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/r6124hf75knvuwwldnvmmgjijlwq6b5.ogg"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"力量增长了，身体的负担随之剧增…哦，我没事，我的构造不同常人，请不用担心。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/bc5mn6ttqjyrszx6jafzbolvmiqahs3.ogg"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"原来如此，驱动「神之眼」驾驭元素力，对于常人而言不啻伟业。哦，原来如此…那时的他们，是抱着这样的觉悟站在我身旁啊…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/lps7byx4al24wyr0wd2aaqv4wsi2kk5.ogg"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"不曾料想，放下「神之心」后，还能看到这种景色——感谢你，「朋友」...对了，我这里有一份新的「契约」，不一起来看看么？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/svzpbta2jimqq8yvjjq7vqzzkfn9uyn.ogg"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"壁立千仞。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/m737hnbohw7gc982mzvjxu96wgu6ezu.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"震天撼地。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/l0xd8t8yhixbneddj7oq529x7ybwbic.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"靡坚不摧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6a/fgn21yelsm0awkttu7fyluw9nwyskwj.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"俱收并蓄。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bb/e11pp449z14z20ylhl9zsu40mkjh2u8.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"安如磐石。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7a/tm8o2vri1vzhqevyzc2k0wvu2mnz6aa.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其六","desc":"固若金汤。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ed/0j9q2hqo1d31p3onv4ugy5yv0ipk4v3.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"天理长驱。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/0fwho60u2plawwnva3kjst31nv3s9b3.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"此乃天道。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/dok1rthzjzz32zy67953ybv821jdnlf.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"天动万象。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/laajxu0h67asmm2hj4iqh9jfnesiz66.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"遗珠弃璧，吉光片裘…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/o9jbf9qdkym5lx2mzbobjbtetpjs4vy.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"偶遇之物，亦有风雅。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2f/72xembx7n5hx2h5dh740zvyj4gvxq0q.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"不虚此行。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/kmeqf376yqho4ioluo4owcnfdy0s3z6.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"你的实力我姑且认可。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/jdedpojv2vb2jh9jfmbp0nmhlye5bad.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"哈，有点意思。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/bzo4rc3pjgon8zrkxz38bqzdd16npsf.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"不太擅长危机应对啊。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/c9etv64037bdr3rieytaoduho2gapc5.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"不可贸然进攻。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/r8dphgwf221nr4dv2ciqe011cok3ukv.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"下去休息。这里交给我。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a5/21c9vxgk1wsmmrv5irhw8s4sz3gak9e.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"啊，略感疲惫…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/ntm37n5x7w0dzzpxshbs451aqpcnffo.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"让你看到，难堪的一面了啊。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/botytxrmcxmcnpdq6qv29buurby13yk.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"磐石…也会归于尘土…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/nhjkuxxez8sgu7ds0uw7v6o4ucw62q9.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"大意了吗。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/2orxbblo8b6yitpxk9p0zkudoj73fr8.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"不足为惧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_zhongli/vo_zhongli_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/qcz7goq6ohdeikq6z39ffs1ombrr85z.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"也好。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_zhongli_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/cfyidxkgsxifet2par1ybym9b1q0l97.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"就当是散心了。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_zhongli_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/pn5vmwnaus4bjcpdk03x6mw5qarcop9.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"做些什么好呢…","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_zhongli_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b2/3lq18wj3dym6chfxq2h68q6hbwdbik6.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000030-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000030-full.webp","fullArtWidth":939,"fullArtHeight":1017}